  "remarks": "Zulu Ships Management is a shipping company based in the United Arab Emirates, which manages tankers transporting Russian crude oil, including for export purposes. The company manages 8 oil tankers subject to Union restrictive measures, out of which at least one has transported crude oil or petroleum products, originating in Russia or exported from Russia, while practicing irregular and high-risk shipping practices as set out in the International Maritime Organisation General Assembly resolution A.1192(33).",
